interface.signature:
POST /api/check-rain
Request Headers: Content-Type: application/json
Request Body: { location: string }
Response Success (200): { willRain: boolean, probability: number, rainWindows?: Array<{start: string, end: string}>, peakTime?: string, intensity?: string, amount?: string, safeWindows?: Array<{start: string, end: string}>, closeCall: boolean }
Response Error (4xx/5xx): { error: ErrorCode, message: string, suggestions?: string[] }
HTTP Status Codes: 200 (success), 400 (invalid request), 404 (location not found), 500 (server error), 504 (timeout)
